Chapter: MaterialEditor
  cites Spark chapter SceneMaterial
  cites Spark chapter TextureMap
  cites Spark chapter ColorPicker

 Material editing with PBR-inspired properties. Supports
 albedo, metallic, roughness, emission, and texture assignment.
 Preview renders a sphere with the material applied.
 All values fixed-point scale 1000.

 We say:

Section: Types

  PbrMaterial = record {
    pbr-name : Text,
    pbr-albedo : Integer,
    pbr-metallic : Integer,
    pbr-roughness : Integer,
    pbr-emission : Integer,
    pbr-emission-strength : Integer,
    pbr-opacity : Integer,
    pbr-albedo-tex : Integer,
    pbr-normal-tex : Integer
  }

  MaterialSlot =
    | SlotAlbedo
    | SlotMetallic
    | SlotRoughness
    | SlotEmission

  MaterialLibState = record {
    mls-materials : List PbrMaterial,
    mls-count : Integer,
    mls-selected : Integer
  }

